What is the output of the following polymorphic method call program?
```java
class SoundEmitter {
    void emit() {
        System.out.print("Sound ");
    }
}
class BellEmitter extends SoundEmitter {
    @Override
    void emit() {
        System.out.print("Chime ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SoundEmitter se = new BellEmitter();
        se.emit();
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following field vs method resolution snippet?
```java
class BaseVal {
    int val = 10;
    int getVal() { return val; }
}
class SubVal extends BaseVal {
    int val = 20;
    @Override
    int getVal() { return val; }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BaseVal bv = new SubVal();
        System.out.println(bv.val + "," + bv.getVal());
    }
}
```

